<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"/>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>{{ .Title }} - RedForceSecurity</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;900&family=Share+Tech+Mono&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    :root {
      --red: #e63946; --red-dim: rgba(230,57,70,0.12);
      --bg: #0a0a0a; --surface: #111; --border: #1e1e1e;
      --text: #e8e8e8; --muted: #666;
    }
    body { background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }

    nav {
      position: fixed; top: 20px; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 100;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 0 3rem; height: 52px;
      background: rgba(10,10,10,0.97); backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .nav-brand { display: flex; align-items: center; }
    .nav-brand img { height: 52px; width: auto; display: block; object-fit: contain; position: absolute; top: 0px; left: 2.5rem; z-index: 101; mix-blend-mode: screen; background: transparent; }
    .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 2.5rem; list-style: none; align-items: center; }
    .nav-links a { color: var(--muted); text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 500; transition: color 0.2s; }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: #fff; }
    .nav-cta { background: var(--red) !important; color: #fff !important; padding: 0.5rem 1.3rem; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 600 !important; }

    .page-layout {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 0.55fr 2fr;
      gap: 4rem;
      min-height: 100vh;
      padding: 10rem 4rem 4rem 0;
      max-width: 100%;
    }

    .page-stats {
      display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.5rem;
    }
    .stat-block {
      border-left: 3px solid var(--red);
      padding: 1.3rem 1.5rem;
      background: var(--surface);
      border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0;
      transition: border-color 0.2s;
    }
    .stat-block:hover { background: #161616; border-color: #ff4d5a; }
    .stat-number { font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace; font-size: 2.4rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--red); line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
    .stat-label { font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.5; }
    .stat-label strong { color: #ccc; display: block; margin-bottom: 3px; font-size: 0.9rem; }

    .page-wrapper { padding: 0 4rem 4rem 0; }
    .page-title {
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem); font-weight: 900; color: #fff;
      letter-spacing: -1px; margin-bottom: 3rem;
      padding-bottom: 1.5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .page-content h2 { font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; margin: 2.5rem 0 1rem; padding-left: 2.5rem; border-left: 3px solid var(--red); }
    .page-content h3 { font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; margin: 2rem 0 0.75rem; }
    .page-content p { color: #aaa; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 0.95rem; }
    .page-content ul { padding-left: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
    .page-content ul li { color: #aaa; line-height: 1.8; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 0.3rem; }
    .page-content strong { color: #fff; }
    .page-content a { color: var(--red); text-decoration: none; }
    .page-content a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
    .page-content hr { border: none; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); margin: 2.5rem 0; }
    .page-content blockquote { border-left: 3px solid var(--red); padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem; background: var(--red-dim); border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0; margin: 1.5rem 0; }
    .page-content blockquote p { color: #ccc; margin: 0; }

    footer {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 2rem 4rem;
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between;
      font-size: 0.78rem; color: #444; font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace;
    }
    footer a { color: #555; text-decoration: none; }
    footer a:hover { color: var(--red); }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <nav>
    <a href="/" class="nav-brand"><img src="/img/logo2.png" alt="RedForceSecurity"/></a>
    <ul class="nav-links">
      <li><a href="/">Inicio</a></li>
      <li><a href="/sobre-mi/">Sobre mi</a></li>
      <li><a href="/servicios/">Servicios</a></li>
      <li><a href="/contacto/" class="nav-cta">Contacto</a></li>
    </ul>
  </nav>

  <div class="page-layout">
    <div class="page-stats">
      <div class="stat-block">
        <div class="stat-number">94%</div>
        <div class="stat-label"><strong>Ataques evitables</strong>de los ciberataques exitosos podrian haberse prevenido con medidas basicas</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-block">
        <div class="stat-number">287</div>
        <div class="stat-label"><strong>Dias de media</strong>tarda una empresa en detectar que ha sido comprometida</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-block">
        <div class="stat-number">4.5M</div>
        <div class="stat-label"><strong>Euros de coste medio</strong>por brecha de seguridad en empresas europeas en 2024</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-block">
        <div class="stat-number">43%</div>
        <div class="stat-label"><strong>Ataques a pymes</strong>de los ciberataques van dirigidos a pequenas y medianas empresas</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="page-wrapper">
      <h1 class="page-title">{{ .Title }}</h1>
      <div class="page-content">{{ .Content }}</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <footer>
    <span>2026 RedForceSecurity -- J.M. Bricio</span>
    <a href="mailto:jm.bricio@redforcesecurity.com">jm.bricio@redforcesecurity.com</a>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>